  "sig_preimage": "Ed25519 over canonical JSON of {kind, schema, as_of, merkle_root, card_count, did_intended} only. card_sha256[] is bound by merkle_root. PKCS8 stays on Pages; the caller authenticates by GitHub OIDC or the pod token. Not a certificate."
